@startuml
title UI Theme Family Lifecycle (Abstract Factory Demo)

[*] --> DarkThemeSelected : new DarkThemeFactory()
DarkThemeSelected --> DarkWidgetsCreated : createButton() + createInput()
DarkWidgetsCreated --> DarkRendered : button.render() + input.render()
DarkRendered --> LightThemeSelected : new LightThemeFactory()
LightThemeSelected --> LightWidgetsCreated : createButton() + createInput()
LightWidgetsCreated --> LightRendered : button.render() + input.render()
LightRendered --> [*] : demo ends

@enduml
